			"notes": "- You can now breed cindershells with warped and crimson fungus, you can breed lizards with apple slices, and you can breed yetis with berries.\n- You can now earn the trust of yetis by feeding them a melon slice. This means that they will no longer become hostile when you are too close to their babies.\n- Added a lizard egg item/block\n- Added cindershell in a bucket\n- Sporelings will now remove curses from items at the cost of durability, and they will convert dropped dirt items to mycelium."
